<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric ENT (Ear, Nose and Throat)</h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric ENT Department, we specialise in the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of disorders affecting the ears, nose, throat, head, and neck in children—from newborns to adolescents. With advanced diagnostic tools, child-friendly surgical techniques, and a multidisciplinary approach, we ensure precise care that supports healthy hearing, breathing, speech, and overall development.</p>
<p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Audiology and Hearing Assessment</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Age-appropriate hearing tests, including otoacoustic emissions (OAE), auditory brainstem response (ABR), pure tone audiometry, and impedance audiometry to detect congenital or acquired hearing impairments.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Nasal and Sinus Evaluation</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Clinical assessment and nasal endoscopy (when required) to diagnose allergic rhinitis, sinusitis, nasal blockages, deviated septum, polyps, and congenital anomalies.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Throat and Airway Examination</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Flexible fibreoptic laryngoscopy for detailed assessment of voice disorders, breathing difficulties, recurrent cough, stridor, and airway abnormalities.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Sleep and Breathing Studies</h5>
</div>
<p>Sleep assessments to diagnose conditions such as obstructive sleep apnoea (OSA), snoring disorders, and nocturnal breathing irregularities.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricENT.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Adenoid and Tonsil Disorders</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Management of enlarged adenoids and tonsils causing recurrent infections, breathing difficulty, snoring, or sleep apnoea. Includes medical therapy and surgical procedures such as adenoidectomy and tonsillectomy.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Middle Ear Disease Management</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Treatment of otitis media with effusion, recurrent ear infections, and hearing loss. Services include grommet insertion, hearing rehabilitation, and long-term monitoring.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Hearing Loss and Hearing Rehabilitation</h5>
</div>
<p>Comprehensive management of conductive and sensorineural hearing loss, including hearing aids, bone conduction devices, cochlear implant evaluation, and post-implant therapy.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Airway and Breathing Disorders</h5>
</div>
<p>Management of conditions such as laryngomalacia, subglottic stenosis, tracheomalacia, and chronic stridor using minimally invasive techniques and multidisciplinary airway care.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Paediatric Sinus Surgery</h5>
</div>
<p>Endoscopic procedures for chronic sinusitis, nasal obstruction, and anatomical abnormalities are performed using child-specific instrumentation for precision and safety.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Neck Masses and Congenital Abnormalities</h5>
</div>
<p>Evaluation and surgical treatment of congenital cysts, thyroglossal duct cysts, branchial anomalies, lymph node enlargement, and benign neck lesions.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Allergy and Immunotherapy Support</h5>
</div>
<p>Management of allergic rhinitis, chronic nasal congestion, recurrent throat infections, and allergy-triggered ENT symptoms through medical therapy and specialist allergy care.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Hearing and Speech Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Integrated services involving audiologists and speech therapists for hearing loss, speech delay, articulation problems, and post-surgery rehabilitation.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Airway and Sleep Disorders Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Comprehensive care for children with snoring, sleep apnoea, noisy breathing, and chronic airway issues, with personalised treatment plans.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Voice and Swallowing Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Assessment and management of hoarseness, vocal cord issues, swallowing difficulties, and speech-related ENT problems.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Recurrent Infection Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Evaluation and long-term management of children with frequent throat, ear, or sinus infections, identifying contributing factors such as allergies, adenoid hypertrophy, or immune issues.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Allergy and Rhinitis Clinic</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Focused care for seasonal and perennial allergies, nasal obstruction, sneezing, itching, and chronic congestion.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animated">Rehabilitation, Follow-Up and Family Support</h4>
<p class="fadeInUp animated">We provide structured follow-up programmes that focus on hearing improvement, airway health, speech development, allergy control, and long-term prevention of ENT complications. Our multidisciplinary team, including ENT surgeons, audiologists, speech therapists, and paediatricians, ensures continuous support for families and optimal outcomes for every child.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-5 fadeInUp animatable">
<h4>We have dedicated clinic for</h4>
</div>
